{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1556360/extras/WISHLIST_NOW_B2.png?t=1742290135\" /> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">STORY:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1556360/extras/gif3.gif?t=1742290135\" /><strong>The game takes place in the subconscious mind of its female protagonist.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You find yourself in an old, abandoned wrestling gym. It is empty, silent\u2026 but the silence is deceiving. Soon, you realize that you are not just a night watchman\u2014you are trapped in the distorted space of your own mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>This abandoned gym is merely a shell.</strong> Inside, it holds fragments of the past, broken memories, and entities that conceal a terrifying truth. You must explore this unsettling world, facing what was meant to be forgotten, time and time again.<br><strong>But are you ready to see where it all leads?</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> FEATURES: </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1556360/extras/gif2.gif?t=1742290135\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique experience from gameplay and atmosphere.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A true dive into the unconscious. Filled with important memories and images.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> The unusual storytelling. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Multiple types of gameplay.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">GAMEPLAY:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1556360/extras/gif1.gif?t=1742290135\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your main duties include: to sit in your office and watch what is happening inside. It is important to realize that you are not alone here...</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use all the possibilities at your disposal so that no one enters your office.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After night shifts, you can leave your workplace. To explore this confusing and mysterious place.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1556360?t=1742290135","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1556360/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742290135","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1556360/0ba45c5acbfa306bcc098ccb16a9d56c9bfa049a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742290135","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1556360/0ba45c5acbfa306bcc098ccb16a9d56c9bfa049a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742290135","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,5],"notes":"The game contains: nudity, sexual content, profanity, bloody bodies and screamers."},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":1556440,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1556360/extras/WISHLIST_NOW_B2.png?t=1742290135\" /> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">STORY:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1556360/extras/gif3.gif?t=1742290135\" /><strong>The game takes place in the subconscious mind of its female protagonist.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You find yourself in an old, abandoned wrestling gy